<title>USA: Federal Home Loan Bank of SF discontinues indices.</title>
<headline>Federal Home Loan Bank of SF discontinues indices.</headline>
<dateline>SAN FRANCISCO 1997-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Federal Home Loan Bank of San Francisco on Friday said it would no longer calculate and publish semiannual cost-of-fund indices for Arizona, California, Nevada and the 11th district.</p>
<p>The bank said it decided to eliminate costs associated with the calculation and publication of the indices because they were seldom used.</p>
<p>Publication would cease after the six-month period ending June 30, the bank said.</p>
<p>((New York newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
</text>
